{
  "info": {
    "name": "LMS - user-service (Phase 2: Security)",
    "description": "Phase 2 security demo for user-service (David Coulter).\n\n**Everything goes through the gateway on http://localhost:8080** - /auth/** reaches Keycloak, /api/users/** reaches user-service via Eureka.\n\nRun the folders in order. Folder 1 stores tokens in collection variables that folders 2-5 reuse.\n\nFolders:\n0. No token \u2192 401\n1. Authentication - password grant, three roles, bad password\n2. Authorization - same endpoints, different roles, 200 vs 403\n3. Registration - public sign-up, duplicate rejected, new account logs in\n4. Password reminder - reset email, and no account enumeration\n5. Bearer token across services - reuse, statelessness, tampering\n\nThe password-reminder email appears in MailHog at http://localhost:8025.\nEureka's dashboard is at http://localhost:8761.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gatewayUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "teacherToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "newUserToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "newProfileId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 \u00b7 No token \u2192 401",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/users/teachers (no Authorization header)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "The baseline. Every endpoint except register, password-reminder and whoami requires a bearer token. This is the service refusing an anonymous caller.",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/api/users/teachers",
              "host": [
                "{{gatewayUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "teachers"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "console.log('WWW-Authenticate:', pm.response.headers.get('WWW-Authenticate'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 \u00b7 Authentication",
      "description": "Log in through the gateway. Keycloak issues a JWT; nothing downstream ever sees a password.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as student1",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Password grant through the gateway at /auth. Keycloak returns a signed JWT. The console prints the username, realm roles and issuer from the token payload.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password"
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "learninghub-spa"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "student1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "student123"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gatewayUrl}}/auth/realms/learninghub/protocol/openid-connect/token",
              "host": [
                "{{gatewayUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "realms",
                "learninghub",
                "protocol",
                "openid-connect",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 - Keycloak issued a token', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('got an access_token', () => pm.expect(b.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('studentToken', b.access_token);",
                  "// decode the payload so the roles are visible in the console during the demo",
                  "const payload = JSON.parse(atob(b.access_token.split('.')[1]));",
                  "console.log('user:', payload.preferred_username, '| roles:', payload.realm_access.roles.join(', '));",
                  "console.log('issuer:', payload.iss);",
                  "pm.test('token carries realm roles', () => pm.expect(payload.realm_access.roles).to.be.an('array'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
